 ## 1. Why
-
-Providing the AI with raw JSON blobs containing escaped newlines (`
-`) and HTML entities (`&#039;`) is inefficient and reduces the AI's "intelligence." By cleaning up documentation and using a retry mechanism for background analysis lag, we provide the LLM with a high-quality "Senior Engineer" level prompt.
